{"title":"CSS Skin Compilation/Contest Styles","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS_Skin_Compilation&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CSS Skin Compilation (page does not exist)\">CSS Skin Compilation</a>\n</p><p>Welcome to the CSS Contests Page!\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Contests will link to a post or a new wiki page.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>As this page is basically dead, the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:CreativeHedgehog\">CreativeHedgehog</a> has revived it! <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:CreativeHedgehog\">CreativeHedgehog</a> will style the page as well.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Past_Parts\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Past Parts</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#The_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Contests</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Newer_Parts\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Newer Parts</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Contests</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Ongoing_Contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ongoing Contests</span></a>